/P 229 0 R
/E (Arrive at Kathmandu Airport, where our representative will warmly welcome you and transfer you to your hotel \(approximately 30 minutes\). After check-in and some time to refresh, visit the sacred Pashupatinath Temple to witness the mesmerizing Sandhya Aarati on the banks of the Bagmati River. Surrounded by devotional chants, traditional music, and sacred rituals, this divine ceremony offers a truly soul-stirring introduction to Nepal's spiritual heritage. Return to the hotel for an overnight stay in Kathmandu.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
