298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (After breakfast, check out from the hotel and embark on a scenic drive to Jomsom, the gateway to the mystical Mustang region. En route, stop at the spectacular Rupse Waterfall, one of Nepal's most beautiful cascades and a perfect spot for photography. As the journey continues through rugged mountain roads, dramatic gorges, and the unique semi-arid landscapes of Mustang, you'll witness some of Nepal's most breathtaking scenery. Upon arrival in Jomsom, enjoy a refreshing welcome drink, check in to your hotel, and spend the rest of the day relaxing and acclimatizing to the higher altitude. Overnight stay in Jomsom.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
