/P 232 0 R
/E (Begin your day early with a scenic drive to the sacred Muktinath Temple, one of the holiest pilgrimage sites revered by both Hindus and Buddhists. Seek divine blessings, perform puja, and experience the peaceful spiritual atmosphere of this revered shrine nestled amidst the majestic Himalayas. Return to Jomsom for breakfast at the hotel, check out, and begin your picturesque drive back to Pokhara. Upon arrival, check in to your hotel and relax after a fulfilling day. Overnight stay in Pokhara.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
