<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 233 0 R
/E (After breakfast, set out to explore the natural beauty and cultural treasures of Pokhara. Begin with a visit to the revered Bindabasini Temple, followed by the stunning Seti River Gorge. Continue to the spectacular Devi's Fall and the mystical Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave, known for its sacred shrine and unique limestone formations. Later, enjoy a peaceful boat ride across the serene Phewa Lake to the beautiful island-based Barahi Temple. Spend the evening at leisure, soaking in the charm of Pokhara's vibrant Lakeside before returning to your hotel for an overnight stay.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
