/E (After breakfast, check out from the hotel and begin your scenic drive back to Kathmandu. En route, visit the revered Manakamana Temple, dedicated to Goddess Bhagwati, who is believed to fulfill the wishes of her devotees. Enjoy an exciting cable car ride offering breathtaking views of the lush hills, rivers, and surrounding valleys before seeking the Goddess's blessings. Continue your journey to Kathmandu, check in to your hotel upon arrival, and relax for the evening. Overnight stay in Kathmandu.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
>>
