<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
/E (After breakfast, embark on a guided tour of Kathmandu's most iconic spiritual and cultural landmarks. Begin with the sacred Pashupatinath Temple, followed by the magnificent Boudhanath Stupa, one of the largest Buddhist stupas in the world. Continue to the serene Budhanilkantha Temple, home to the remarkable reclining statue of Lord Vishnu \(Jal Narayan\). Later, visit the hilltop Swayambhunath Stupa, popularly known as the Monkey Temple, and enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of the Kathmandu Valley. Spend the evening exploring the vibrant local markets for shopping and souvenirs before returning to your hotel for an overnight stay in Kathmandu.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
